@host=http://localhost:5000

### Root
GET {{host}}/

### Get all users
GET {{host}}/api/users

### Get existing user
GET {{host}}/api/users/1

### Get missing user - should return 404
GET {{host}}/api/users/999

### Create valid user
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Charlie",
  "email": "charlie@example.com"
}

### Create invalid user - should return 400
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "invalid@example.com"
}

### Create duplicate user - should return 409
POST {{host}}/api/users/with-id/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Duplicate Alice",
  "email": "alice2@example.com"
}

### Simulate unexpected failure - should return 500
GET {{host}}/api/users/simulate-failure
